{{Classic Era}}

A planar armor set for [[Monk|Monks]]. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 1|Group 1 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Hate]] and [[Plane of Fear]]. There does not appear to be a named mob that always drops two pieces of this armor.

For whatever reason, there does not appear to be a Shiverback-hide Head slot item.

